import Lake
open Lake DSL

/-!
Erdős Problem #374 — Lean verification package.

* the project's full formal proof of Theorem 1.1 (closure of `Erdos374CompleteWork`), and
* the order-of-growth results for `D3`, `D4`, `D5`, `D6` (modules `E374.*`).

Pinned to Lean `v4.35.0-rc2` and Mathlib `487140449b0eceeb60afe04cab75cdcaaebf227f`.
The project modules use flat (non-hierarchical) module names, so they are listed explicitly.
-/

